专业进阶路径或荣誉项目基础上，再修读1个辅修学士学位项目，辅修学士学位应与主修学士学位归属不同的本科专业大类。","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[]},{"id":"-100","rawId":"-100","parent":null,"level":"1.1.1","title":"其他","type":null,"rule":{"requiredSubModuleNum":0,"requiredCredits":0.0,"postCreditsRequired":0.0,"postRequiredCourseNum":0,"integrationCreditsRequired":0.0,"integrationRequiredCourseNum":0,"requiredCourseNum":0,"autoSubModuleNum":false,"showRequiredCredits":"0","requireAny":true,"requireAll":false},"limit":{"creditsUpperLimit":null,"courseNumUpperLimit":null},"note":"","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[]},{"id":"2~28","rawId":"2","parent":null,"level":"1.1","title":"融合创新能力","type":null,"rule":{"requiredSubModuleNum":0,"requiredCredits":24.0,"postCreditsRequired":0.0,"postRequiredCourseNum":0,"integrationCreditsRequired":0.0,"integrationRequiredCourseNum":0,"requiredCourseNum":0,"autoSubModuleNum":false,"showRequiredCredits":"24","requireAny":true,"requireAll":false},"limit":{"creditsUpperLimit":null,"courseNumUpperLimit":null},"note":"1. 按照“基础型—综合型—创新型”渐次推进、相互衔接的物理实验教学体系，在解决复杂问题的过程中培养实验技能，激发批判性思维和科研潜力。\n2. 全周期的科研训练体系，在1、2年级设立物理前沿导论课和无学分讨论班，引导学生早进课题组轮转，培育兴趣。3年级通过2学期的科研实践训练，完成1项复芏计划（FDUROP）项目（䇹政、望道、登辉和曦源），激发创新志趣。\n3. 多渠道支持学生参加国内国际高水平学术交流，原则上应到具有世界一流水平的国内外机构进行一年左右（累计）的学习、研究或联合培养。鼓励学生参加国内国际高水平创新竞赛（中国国际大学生创新大赛、“挑战杯”全国大学生课外学术科技作品竞赛、全国大学生物理实验竞赛、中国大学生物理学术竞赛等）。","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[{"code":"PHYS10009","name":"大学物理实验Ⅰ","credits":2.0,"required":true,"term":"1","rule":{"requiredCourse":false,"integrationCompulsory":false,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"PHYS10011","name":"物理前沿导论","credits":2.0,"required":true,"term":"2","rule":{"requiredCourse":false,"integrationCompulsory":true,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"101","name":"无学分讨论班","credits":0.0,"required":true,"term":null,"rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"102","name":"复芏计划(FDUROP)","credits":0.0,"required":true,"term":null,"rule":{"r